[I] Lightweight pipelining with Python functions

[T] Joblib is a set of tools to provide lightweight pipelining in Python. In
[T] particular: transparent disk-caching of functions and lazy re-evaluation
[T] (memoize pattern), easy simple parallel computing.

[U] https://joblib.readthedocs.io/

